From 0c42a2a9d7ed4862c9c0303d63d7e6a3d69d68cf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 1vivy <1vivy@tutanota.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 16:50:49 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 14/16] infiniti: report the stock OTA version

Our build leaves ro.build.version.ota unset, so AIUnit resolves its
ai::key::ota_version cloud-request field to the literal sentinel
"ota_version" and the OPPO AIGC cloud soft-denies every generation
request to an empty payload (errCode=0, null/0 body) - AI Recompose
and AI Eraser silently produce nothing while the rest of the pipeline
(upload, dispatch, polling) works.

Set the OTA version of the stock OOS 16.0.8 build this tree's blobs
are extracted from, matching what the OEM ROM reports. Verified live
on-device under enforcing SELinux: adding only this property makes the
cloud return real AIGC content.

Change-Id: I1c58201520ff05ff04d322ab8fd2a7f3320991af
(cherry picked from commit a7c3145af552ce3af3c42cde74c74d07df7fcf5e)
---
 device.mk | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/device.mk b/device.mk
index 96e7811..b36ac08 100644
--- a/device.mk
+++ b/device.mk
@@ -55,6 +55,10 @@ PRODUCT_PACKAGES += \
 PRODUCT_PACKAGES += \
     vendor.lineage.powershare-service.oplus
 
+# Properties
+PRODUCT_PRODUCT_PROPERTIES += \
+    ro.build.version.ota=CPH2745_11.A.42_0420_202606022356
+
 # Recovery
 $(call soong_config_set_bool,recovery,target_recovery_uses_qti_drm,true)
 
